n\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\\\\n&\\forall F\\in[T_c]^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathfrak N_G[a/c]\\models_{L'}F),\\\\\n&\\exists\\mathfrak M'\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_{L'}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathfrak M'\\models_{L'}T_c\\land\n\\mathrm{NonStd}_G(\\mathfrak M'\\upharpoonright L_G)\\land\nc^{\\mathfrak M'}\\notin\\{\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M'}\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"c\\neq\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":">","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false}],"bytes":2142,"backlinks":[{"id":"8757635b793ed303","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这是把[[92-ex-nonstandard-model]]的扩张语言构造与紧致性定理合并后的推论；原式把仅是公理集的$\\mathrm{PA}$误当成了$\\mathrm{Con}$所接收的形式系统"}],"outgoing":["1a9a64dce00ebd76","ccb738ae4bbf923c","47757ea7c4cfcbd4","89c266445c099752","b78092e29a02d697","fd60117fc80e6f95","2b7f27c890af1dc3"]}